Z||000002||Formula88||09-30-2001||12:43 PM||||Well, the problem with dongles is they usually aren't available separately.  I know for a Compaq Netelligent card, the NIC and dongle are $90, but the dongle by itself is $70, so you're not really saving anything there.  <P>I'll look around work to see what I can find, but your best bet would be to check out CompUSA or a local computer store and see if they have any spares.  You're not likely to find one retail for a reasonable price.||||reg||6
